\end{figure}

At the tip of the pole, an ergonomic grip containing 4 vibration motors is mounted, which will allow for directional hazard warnings. We also take this opportunity to implement a convenient user feedback system, in the form of a joystick mounted on the pole's end, to allow for a manual drive mode. In addition, two buttons will be added to implement mode control and emergency stop. 

