\subsubsection{\textbf{Speech Interface and Command Interpretation}}\label{sec:speech}
The speech interface allows the user to talk to the robot through a commercial wireless earpiece directly connected to the LLM Jetson over Bluetooth. Its microphone captures spoken requests, and its speaker delivers  urgent warnings of the third feedback level (e.g. imminent collision or emergency stop), and direct responses to the user's perception questions. 
