To validate the the robot, the agile framework was followed, to allow quick, iterative development of the system. 
Initial sprints will focus on developing and individual systems and later sprints will start integrating the systems together, moving upwards until we have the whole robotic system. This approach would allow quicker debugging and error correction.  

